{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-project-context#card-zh","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-project-context","commit":"4fbb59743db1d8dff3b36349761cf65526bb3fdb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-context 是面向 DSH Web 的工作区用途插件：它在启动时创建并登记固定的临时工作区，在侧边栏提供临时会话入口，并在临时会话标题显示徽标。它会为项目工作区注入独立的项目约定消息，临时会话和无工作目录的会话不注入。插件还会将临时工作区 ID 保存在 DSH_HOME 下的状态文件中，并通过只读状态端点供浏览器界面读取。适合希望把一次性问答与项目开发会话分开的 DSH Web 用户；不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:329-374","lib/client.js:328-371","lib/state.js:16-28"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-project-context#card-en","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-project-context","commit":"4fbb59743db1d8dff3b36349761cf65526bb3fdb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-project-context separates project workspaces from temporary sessions in DSH Web. It creates a fixed temporary workspace, adds a sidebar shortcut and labels its sessions. Project sessions receive a conventions message; temporary sessions do not. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:329-374","lib/client.js:328-371","lib/state.js:16-28"]}
