{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-project-context#feature-1","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-project-context","commit":"4fbb59743db1d8dff3b36349761cf65526bb3fdb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-context 的功能「临时会话工作区」：启动时在 DSH_HOME/workspace/default 创建固定临时目录，并复用或登记对应工作区；失败不会阻止插件加载，后续可重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:239-275"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-project-context#feature-2","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-project-context","commit":"4fbb59743db1d8dff3b36349761cf65526bb3fdb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-context 的功能「「项目约定注入」」：在 agent/pre-step 阶段识别项目工作区，并以独立 user 消息注入工作目录约定；内容不变时避免重复，临时会话不注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:329-368"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-project-context#feature-3","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-project-context","commit":"4fbb59743db1d8dff3b36349761cf65526bb3fdb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-context 的功能「「侧边栏临时会话入口」」：侧边栏按钮可在固定临时工作区开启会话；工作区未就绪时不可用，当前会话已空白时不会重复新建。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:202-285"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-project-context#feature-4","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-project-context","commit":"4fbb59743db1d8dff3b36349761cf65526bb3fdb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-context 的功能「「临时会话徽标」」：当 workspaces 快照显示会话属于固定临时工作区时，在会话标题操作区显示临时会话徽标。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:288-325"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-project-context#feature-5","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-project-context","commit":"4fbb59743db1d8dff3b36349761cf65526bb3fdb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-context 的功能「「工作区状态接口」」：提供只读 GET /__workspace-purpose/state 接口，返回临时工作区 ID、路径和就绪状态，供客户端显示按钮状态与徽标。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:283-315"]}
